<h2 id="what-is-esignly">🖊️ What Is Esignly?</h2>

Esignly is a cloud-based eSignature and document management platform built for businesses that need fast, legally binding digital signatures without the complexity or cost of enterprise tools like DocuSign or Adobe Sign. Founded with a focus on SMB workflows, Esignly lets you upload your own consent forms, build templates from scratch, and collect signatures via email link, SMS, or an in-clinic tablet — all tracked in a central dashboard.

For aesthetics clinics specifically, the appeal is straightforward: stop printing, scanning, and filing paper consent forms. Build your Botox, filler, chemical peel, and laser consent templates once, and collect signed documents from every client before they hit the treatment chair — no front-desk scramble required.

Esignly is not a purpose-built med spa EMR. It does not handle booking, charting, before-and-after photos, or payment processing. What it does handle — document collection and eSignature workflow — it handles cleanly and at a price point that won't sting a practice still building its client base.

